+/* The 3D world is fill-rate bound on this CPU, so it is rendered into a smaller
+   buffer and upscaled into the full resolution display buffer at the end of the
+   3D pass (Gfx_End3D). The 2D UI is then drawn into the display buffer at panel
+   resolution, so buttons and text stay crisp regardless of the world resolution.
